Subject: [PATCH 4/5] test(edm): pin the leaning wire's upper-section gouge and
 kerf reach

taper_tests.rs (sim verify/wire): a_gouge_only_in_an_upper_section_blocks
fails if Wire::at ignores the lean; the_leaning_kerf_reaches_past_the_vertical_one
fails if the reach k*sqrt(1+(t.u)^2) becomes k.

Refs #536

